<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>白水晶 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><description>Recent content in 白水晶 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>白水晶功效與淨化：石英入門保養指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;白水晶（Clear Quartz）是無色透明至乳白色的石英。&lt;/strong&gt;「放大能量」「淨化」是水晶文化中的象徵說法，與物理清潔是兩件事。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>頂輪是什麼？從人生意義談千瓣蓮花的象徵</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;有時你不是缺少「更高的能量」，只是想知道現在做的事對自己有什麼意義。頂輪的千瓣蓮花意象，可以拿來問這個問題；它不是判斷一個人是否開悟的標準。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>